# GS-017: Respiration can alter pressure despite equal formal O2 and CO2 coefficients
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 glucose 0.00005mol
seal v1 100mL
add v1 O2 0.001mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
react v1 respiration
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
measure v1 ph
inspect
